MITRE ATT@CK



1️⃣ Reconnaissance
      ↓
Gather information about the target

2️⃣ Resource Development
      ↓
Prepare infrastructure (domains, malware, phishing)

3️⃣ Initial Access
      ↓
Get inside the organization

4️⃣ Execution
      ↓
Run malicious code

5️⃣ Persistence
      ↓
Maintain access after reboot

6️⃣ Privilege Escalation
      ↓
Gain higher privileges

7️⃣ Defense Evasion
      ↓
Avoid detection

8️⃣ Credential Access
      ↓
Steal usernames, passwords, hashes

9️⃣ Discovery
      ↓
Learn about the environment

🔟 Lateral Movement
      ↓
Move to other systems

1️⃣1️⃣ Collection
      ↓
Gather valuable data

1️⃣2️⃣ Command & Control
      ↓
Communicate with compromised systems

1️⃣3️⃣ Exfiltration
      ↓
Steal data outside the organization

1️⃣4️⃣ Impact
      ↓
Damage systems or business operations
